{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28118","headline":"詶李绀岁除送酒 · 雍陶","name":"詶李绀岁除送酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁尽贫生事事须，就中深恨酒钱无。\n故人充寿能分送，远客消愁免自沽。\n一夜四乘倾凿落，五更三点把屠苏。\n已供时节深珍重，况许今朝更挈壶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}